      "SourceElementId": "G11-U03-L06-ACTIVITY-003",
      "SourceSection": "6.2: Finding Square Roots",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Clare was adding \\(\\sqrt{4}\\) and \\(\\sqrt{9}\\), and at first she wrote \\(\\sqrt{4} + \\sqrt{9} = 2+3\\). But then she remembered that 2 and -2 both square to make 4, and that 3 and -3 both square to make 9. She wrote down all the possible…",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u03-l06.rich-lesson-v2.json",
      "Treatment": "SOURCE_SCOPED_AUTHORING_WITH_TEACHER_REVIEW",
      "TestsExecuted": "NOT_RUN"
    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U03-L06-ACTIVITY-004",
      "SourceSection": "6.2: Finding Square Roots",
      "SourceExcerpt": "2 + 3 = 5 2 + (-3) = -1 (-2) + 3 = 1 (-2) + (-3) = -5",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u03-l06.rich-lesson-v2.json",
      "Treatment": "SOURCE_SCOPED_AUTHORING_WITH_TEACHER_REVIEW",
      "TestsExecuted": "NOT_RUN"
    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U03-L06-ACTIVITY-005",
      "SourceSection": "6.2: Finding Square Roots",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Then she wondered, “Which of these are the same as \\(\\sqrt{4} + \\sqrt{9}\\)? All of them? Or only some? Or just one?”",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u03-l06.rich-lesson-v2.json",
      "Treatment": "SOURCE_SCOPED_AUTHORING_WITH_TEACHER_REVIEW",
      "TestsExecuted": "NOT_RUN"
    },
    {
